        "original_id": "d2ee69e7-3ee8-5417-a664-e2d666555693",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chuck Taylor, Ricochet, Brandon Walker, Trevor Mann\n- Organizations: Old School Wrestling Training Academy, Chaos Pro Wrestling\n- Places: Hardin, Kentucky, Brookport, Illinois\n- Topics: wrestling training, professional wrestling careers, friendship\n\nFacts:\n- Chuck Taylor, also known as Howard, began wrestling training at age 15 under Brandon Walker at the Old School Wrestling Training Academy in Hardin, Kentucky.\n- Chuck Taylor later worked for the newly restarted Chaos Pro Wrestling in Brookport, Illinois, where he began a friendship with Ricochet.\n- Ricochet is the ring name of Trevor Mann, an American professional wrestler born on October 11, 1988.",
